{"seq":2,"slug":"replication-lag-read","title":"复制延迟与读己之写、单调读","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-consistency/replication-lag-read","wordCount":2635,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"复制延迟与读己之写-单调读\">复制延迟与读己之写、单调读</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「复制延迟」是一个被过度简化成单个数字的概念。当有人说「我们的复制延迟是 50ms」时，他通常指的是某个平均值或某个百分位，但这个数字对应用开发者几乎没有指导意义——真正需要回答的问题是：<strong>在这 50ms 里，什么样的读会出错，出错时用户看到什么</strong>。把延迟从「一个数」拆成「一组可独立承诺、可独立测试的会话保证」，是让多区域读取既不牺牲体验也不产生困惑的前提。</p>\n<p>跨区复制延迟本身由三部分构成，它们的可优化空间完全不同：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{repl} = L_{network} + L_{apply} + L_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{network}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">tw</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是链路传播与传输时延，由物理距离与链路质量决定，通常占据主要部分且几乎不可优化；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{apply}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是备库重放日志的耗时，受并行复制度、事务大小、索引维护影响，是<strong>最能通过配置优化的部分</strong>；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{queue}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是待重放的日志积压所对应的等待，它是一个状态量而非固定成本，在备库短暂变慢时会迅速放大。把这三者混成一个数字，会导致优化方向错误——例如为了降低「延迟」去优化网络，而真实瓶颈是备库单线程重放。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[主库提交事务 T] --&gt; N[跨区链路传播]&#10;  N --&gt; Q[备库中继日志排队]&#10;  Q --&gt; A[备库并行重放]&#10;  A --&gt; V[对该副本可见]&#10;  P -.记录位置 LSN/GTID.-&gt; M[会话位置令牌]&#10;  M --&gt; D{读路由决策}&#10;  V --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt;|令牌已满足| RD[允许读该副本]&#10;  D --&gt;|令牌未满足| WD[路由到更靠前的副本]\">graph TD\n  P[主库提交事务 T] --&gt; N[跨区链路传播]\n  N --&gt; Q[备库中继日志排队]\n  Q --&gt; A[备库并行重放]\n  A --&gt; V[对该副本可见]\n  P -.记录位置 LSN/GTID.-&gt; M[会话位置令牌]\n  M --&gt; D{读路由决策}\n  V --&gt; D\n  D --&gt;|令牌已满足| RD[允许读该副本]\n  D --&gt;|令牌未满足| WD[路由到更靠前的副本]</pre><h2 id=\"四个可独立承诺的会话保证\">四个可独立承诺的会话保证</h2><p>会话保证（session guarantee）的价值在于它们描述的是<strong>用户视角可感知的正确性</strong>，而不是内部状态。四个保证按强度递增排列：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>承诺内容</th>\n<th>违反时的用户可见现象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单调读</td>\n<td>同一会话的后续读不会看到更早的状态</td>\n<td>数据「倒退」：刚看到的评论消失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读己之写</td>\n<td>会话能看到自己此前的写入</td>\n<td>提交订单后刷新看不到自己的订单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单调写</td>\n<td>同一会话的写按提交顺序被应用</td>\n<td>更新被旧值覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有界陈旧度</td>\n<td>读到的数据不早于「现在减去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>」</td>\n<td>看板数据陈旧超出声明范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四者<strong>不能互相推导</strong>：实现了读己之写不保证单调读（用户可能先读到自己的新评论、再读到一个不含该评论的旧列表），实现了单调读不保证有界陈旧度（可以一直单调地读旧快照）。因此它们必须分别声明、分别测试、分别监控。声明「本系统提供会话一致性」而不指明是哪一种，等于没有承诺。</p>\n<h3 id=\"读己之写的最小实现\">读己之写的最小实现</h3><p>实现读己之写需要两样东西：一个能表达「已应用到哪个位置」的令牌，以及一个能让读请求携带它并验证的机制。令牌的形态取决于复制实现——GTID 集合、LSN、逻辑时钟、复制位点都可用。核心流程是：写入返回时把当前位置附在响应中，客户端在后续读时带上它，读路由层检查目标副本的已应用位置是否已覆盖该令牌，未覆盖则改选更靠前的副本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 用 GTID 集合表达会话位置（MySQL 系实现的概念示意）&#10;-- 写入返回给客户端：gtid_executed 快照&#10;-- 读请求携带：session_gtid&#10;&#10;-- 路由层检查某副本是否已覆盖该会话位置&#10;SELECT&#10;  @@hostname                                             AS replica,&#10;  GTID_SUBSET(:session_gtid, @@global.gtid_executed)     AS has_caught_up,&#10;  TIMESTAMPDIFF(MICROSECOND,&#10;                @@global.gtid_executed_time, NOW(6))/1000 AS lag_ms&#10;FROM DUAL;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 用 GTID 集合表达会话位置（MySQL 系实现的概念示意）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 写入返回给客户端：gtid_executed 快照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 读请求携带：session_gtid</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 路由层检查某副本是否已覆盖该会话位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  @@hostname                                             </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> replica</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  GTID_SUBSET(:session_gtid, @@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">global</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtid_executed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_caught_up,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  TIMESTAMPDIFF(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MICROSECOND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                @@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">global</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gtid_executed_time</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lag_ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DUAL;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询的判据是 <code>GTID_SUBSET</code> 为真，即「副本已执行的事务集合包含会话需要的事务集合」。这比比较时间戳可靠得多，因为时间戳在两个副本的时钟不同步时会给出错误结论，而集合包含关系是精确的。</p>\n<p>三个常见的实现陷阱值得单独指出。第一是<strong>令牌丢失</strong>：令牌存放在客户端内存或会话 cookie 中，一旦用户换设备、清缓存或请求被负载均衡分到另一条链路，令牌就丢了，保证随之失效。缓解方式是把令牌存在服务端的用户会话记录里，并在令牌缺失时保守地路由到主库或最新副本。第二是<strong>多写路径</strong>：如果写入经过多个服务或异步队列，返回给客户端的令牌必须反映队列消费后的位置，而不是入队时的位置。第三是<strong>读跨多个分片</strong>：每个分片有自己的位置，读己之写需要对每个分片分别校验，不能只看其中一个。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单调读与粘滞的取舍\">单调读与粘滞的取舍</h3><p>单调读比读己之写更容易实现，也更容易被意外破坏。最小实现是<strong>会话粘滞</strong>——把同一会话的读固定路由到同一个副本。这保证该副本的已应用位置只增不减，因而读不会倒退。但粘滞有一个明显的代价：它把用户绑在某个副本上，当该副本落后或不可用时，用户无法自动切换到更靠前的副本，体验反而变差。</p>\n<p>更健壮的实现是<strong>位置单调</strong>：会话维护一个「已见位置」的高水位，每次读都要求副本位置不低于该水位，读成功后更新水位。这与读己之写共用同一套令牌机制，区别在于水位来自读结果而非写结果。这种实现下副本可以自由切换，只要新副本满足水位要求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>会话粘滞</td>\n<td>实现简单，无需令牌</td>\n<td>副本故障时无法切换，落后副本拖累用户</td>\n<td>副本同质、故障少的部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位置水位</td>\n<td>可自由切换副本</td>\n<td>需要在读路径传递并比较位置</td>\n<td>多区域、副本异构的部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读主库</td>\n<td>保证最强</td>\n<td>放弃就近读的全部收益</td>\n<td>关键读（余额、库存）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"有界陈旧度与延迟感知路由\">有界陈旧度与延迟感知路由</h2><p>有界陈旧度是唯一一个能用 SLA 表述的保证：系统承诺读到的数据不早于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span>。它的实现依赖路由层掌握每个副本的实时落后量，并在落后量超过阈值时把读改派到其他副本或主库。这要求落后量的度量是<strong>准确的</strong>，而这一点在实践中经常失效。</p>\n<p><code>Seconds_Behind_Master</code> 这类指标的已知问题有三个：它基于秒级粗粒度，无法反映亚秒级变化；它在备库中继日志积压但正在拼命重放时会显示为 0 或很小，从而掩盖真实的端到端落后；它无法区分「备库慢」与「主库写入速率突增导致队列变长」。更可靠的做法是<strong>位置差换算</strong>：取主库当前写入位置与备库已应用位置，按最近一段时间的写入速率换算成时间差。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_{est} = \\frac{pos_{primary} - pos_{replica}}{rate_{write}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ima</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个估算对写入速率突变敏感，因此实践中会取两个判据的较大值：位置差换算值与「最近若干秒内位置未推进」的停滞判据。前者捕捉落后量，后者捕捉链路断连——链路断了时位置差会持续增大，但换算公式依赖的速率可能同时归零，导致估算失真。</p>\n<p>延迟感知路由还需要处理一个边界情况：<strong>所有副本都落后超过阈值</strong>。此时可选动作有三个，必须提前确定策略而不是在运行时临时决定——降级为更宽松的陈旧度并记录事件、改派到主库（可能跨区，延迟升高）、或返回错误。多数系统选择第一个，但前提是业务能接受；对关键读则应选第二个。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;read_routing&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;replica_selection&quot;: [&#10;      { &quot;priority&quot;: 1, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;local_replica&quot;, &quot;max_staleness_ms&quot;: 500 },&#10;      { &quot;priority&quot;: 2, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;same_continent_replica&quot;, &quot;max_staleness_ms&quot;: 2000 },&#10;      { &quot;priority&quot;: 3, &quot;target&quot;: &quot;primary&quot;, &quot;max_staleness_ms&quot;: 0 }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;session_guarantees&quot;: [&quot;monotonic_reads&quot;, &quot;read_your_writes&quot;],&#10;    &quot;token_source&quot;: &quot;server_side_session&quot;,&#10;    &quot;on_token_missing&quot;: &quot;route_to_priority_3&quot;,&#10;    &quot;staleness_metric&quot;: &quot;position_delta_converted&quot;,&#10;    &quot;stall_detection_s&quot;: 10&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"read_routing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"replica_selection\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"local_replica\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_staleness_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"same_continent_replica\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_staleness_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"priority\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"primary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_staleness_ms\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"session_guarantees\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"monotonic_reads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"read_your_writes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"token_source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"server_side_session\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"on_token_missing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"route_to_priority_3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"staleness_metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"position_delta_converted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"stall_detection_s\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>on_token_missing</code> 是关键的安全默认值：令牌缺失时保守地走主库，宁可慢也不给出违反保证的结果。这比「令牌缺失时按最近副本读」安全，因为后者会静默地违反已声明的保证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延迟如何影响故障切换\">延迟如何影响故障切换</h2><p>复制延迟不只影响读体验，它还是故障切换的核心输入。切换时「能提升到的最新副本」就是延迟最小的那个副本——如果所有异地副本都落后 3 秒，那么切换时至少丢 3 秒的数据，无论复制模式声明了什么。</p>\n<h3 id=\"监控口径必须与提升判据统一\">监控口径必须与提升判据统一</h3><p>因此延迟监控必须与切换决策使用同一个度量口径，否则会出现「监控显示延迟 50ms、切换时丢了 5 秒数据」这类矛盾。这一点与<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/region-failover-promotion\">区域故障检测与主提升</a>中的提升判据直接相关，监控口径的统一是两篇共同的前提。</p>\n<h3 id=\"延迟分布的尾部分决定-rpo\">延迟分布的尾部分决定 RPO</h3><p>还有一个容易被忽略的细节：决定 RPO 的不是延迟的平均值而是<strong>尾部分</strong>。写入高峰期的延迟第 99 百分位可能比中位数大一个数量级，而故障恰好发生在高峰期时，丢失量由那一刻的真实延迟决定。因此容灾目标的推导必须使用延迟分布的尾部分，而不是监控面板上那个好看的中位数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>复制延迟应拆成链路传播、备库重放、队列积压三部分，只有重放与队列有优化空间；混成单一数字会导致优化方向错误。</li>\n<li>四个会话保证按强度为单调读、读己之写、单调写、有界陈旧度，它们不能互相推导，必须分别声明、测试与监控；含糊的「会话一致性」不是承诺。</li>\n<li>读己之写的最小实现是位置令牌加副本校验，判据用集合包含关系（如 GTID_SUBSET）而非时间戳比较；三个陷阱是令牌丢失、多写路径令牌失真、跨分片令牌未分别校验。</li>\n<li>单调读可用会话粘滞或位置水位实现；粘滞实现简单但副本故障时无法切换，位置水位可自由切换但需在读路径传递位置。</li>\n<li>有界陈旧度的度量应使用位置差换算加停滞判据的双重条件，避免 <code>Seconds_Behind_Master</code> 类指标在积压重放时给出误导性小值；所有副本都超阈值时的动作必须提前确定。</li>\n<li>复制延迟同时是故障切换的核心输入，监控口径必须与提升判据统一，否则会出现监控与切换结论矛盾，见<a href=\"../failover-splitbrain/failover-rto-rpo\">RTO/RPO 目标与切换演练</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"复制延迟与读己之写、单调读","id":"复制延迟与读己之写-单调读"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四个可独立承诺的会话保证","id":"四个可独立承诺的会话保证"},{"level":3,"text":"读己之写的最小实现","id":"读己之写的最小实现"},{"level":3,"text":"单调读与粘滞的取舍","id":"单调读与粘滞的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"有界陈旧度与延迟感知路由","id":"有界陈旧度与延迟感知路由"},{"level":2,"text":"延迟如何影响故障切换","id":"延迟如何影响故障切换"},{"level":3,"text":"监控口径必须与提升判据统一","id":"监控口径必须与提升判据统一"},{"level":3,"text":"延迟分布的尾部分决定 RPO","id":"延迟分布的尾部分决定-rpo"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"同步、异步与半同步复制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-consistency/sync-async-semi-replication"},"next":{"title":"跨区冲突检测与解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-active-active-database/replication-consistency/cross-region-conflict-resolve"}}